  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jala Global: Loan to Develop Tech-Sector Human Capital for Low-Income Latin American Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project consists of a US$5 million loan to support Jala University as a provider of high-quality digital skills education in Latin America. The financing will enable the University to implement its programs, strengthen institutional capacity, and invest in digital platforms and student support services, aiming to expand access to technical education and improve employability outcomes across the region.</narrative>
  </description>
